data/.universe_prices.pkl

# Backtest input cache: raw companyfacts and full price history per symbol,
# already 382MB at 1,446 names. It is a fetch cache, not a result — every
# point-in-time decision is made by extract_series(as_of=) and build(as_of=)
# on whatever they are handed, so a cached fetch and a live one produce the
# same record and this is reproducible by re-warming. data/backtest/obs IS
# committed, because those ARE the measurement.
data/backtest_cache/
